note Exercism-style exercise "leap": https://exercism.org/tracks/python/exercises/leap
note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note Return true when year y is a leap year in the Gregorian calendar: divisible by 4, except
note centuries, except centuries divisible by 400.
note Check it with: sh exercise.sh exercises/leap
om2
fn leap y ulong to bool
if eq rem y 400 0
ret true
end
if eq rem y 100 0
ret false
end
ret eq rem y 4 0
end
